31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. Now that the first night has passed, we must look at the situation with a clear mind. Has anyone noticed anything unusual or felt any intuition?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning! I slept great! I didn't see any werewolves in my dreams, but I'm ready to be a detective now! Does anyone have any clues? Did anyone feel something spooky last night?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It's too early for ""spooky feelings,"" Rin. We need to focus on the facts. Since no one has died yet, we have a clean slate, but the Seer now has their first piece of information. @Jonathan, any thoughts?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm a bit surprised that no one was attacked last night, but maybe we're just lucky. @Mizuki, you're always so logical; do you think the werewolf is just trying to blend in for now?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Luck has nothing to do with it. The werewolf is probably just playing it safe, waiting for us to trust each other so they can strike when we're not looking. Stop being so naive, Midori. We need to start voting.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your urgency is consistent, but we must be careful. I have information that suggests we should be very cautious about who we trust. I believe we have a lead on the werewolf.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Whoa, really?! @Jonathan, you found a clue already? Tell us, tell us! Who is it? Is it someone grumpy? I bet it's someone who's acting super suspicious! Please tell us right now!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, that is a very significant claim. If you are the Seer, revealing your information now could be a strategic move, but it also makes you a target. Please, tell us who you divined and what you found.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, please be careful. If you're the Seer, you're very brave to speak up so soon. We're all listening, so please tell us what you've discovered whenever you feel it's safe to do so.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Stop stalling, @Jonathan! If you've got a lead, spit it out. We're just sitting ducks while you play mysterious. Who is it? Tell us now so we can get rid of them!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will be direct. I am the Seer, and I divined Takumi last night. The result was clear: Takumi is the werewolf. For the safety of the village, I believe we must execute him today.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,"What?! Takumi is the werewolf?! I knew he was being way too grumpy! @Takumi, how could you? You were pretending to be brave, but you're actually the monster! We have to listen to Jonathan!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, that is a bold and clear claim. If you are indeed the Seer, the logic is simple: we execute Takumi. @Takumi, you have been pushing for a vote since the start. How do you respond to this accusation?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, I'm so sorry to hear this, but if Jonathan is the Seer, we have to trust the result. Please, tell us your side of the story. Is there any way this could be a mistake?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"What?! You've gotta be kidding me! @Jonathan, you're lying through your teeth! I'm not the werewolf! You're just using a fake Seer claim to get rid of me because I'm the only one actually trying to win! Don't listen to him!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your denial is expected, but the divination does not lie. I have no reason to deceive the village. For the sake of our survival, I urge everyone to vote for Takumi.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm voting for Takumi! Jonathan is the Seer and he said it's you! You were being mean to everyone, and now we know why! Sorry Takumi, but we have to save the village!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The evidence is straightforward. @Jonathan has claimed the Seer role and provided a specific result. While @Takumi's denial is expected, his aggressive behavior since Day 0 aligns with a desire to force a rushed, incorrect vote. I will vote for Takumi.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I feel so sad that it has come to this, but we have to prioritize the village's safety. @Jonathan, thank you for your courage in telling us. I'll vote for Takumi, though my heart is heavy.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,This is a total setup! @Jonathan is the one lying to you all! He's just trying to look like the hero while he kills us off one by one. You're all making a huge mistake! I'm not the werewolf!,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
